#: course/lesson-10-the-game-loop/rotating-and-moving/TestsRotatingAndMoving.gd:16
msgid "Character Is Moving In A Circle Clockwise"
msgstr "캐릭터가 시계 방향으로 원을 그리며 움직이고 있습니다."

#: course/lesson-10-the-game-loop/rotating-and-moving/TestsRotatingAndMoving.gd:21
#: course/lesson-10-the-game-loop/rotating-sprite/TestsRotating.gd:17
#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-and-moving-delta/TestsRotatingMovingDelta.gd:33
#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:46
msgid "Did you use rotate() to make the sprite rotate?"
msgstr "스프라이트를 회전시키기 위해 rotate()를 사용하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-10-the-game-loop/rotating-and-moving/TestsRotatingAndMoving.gd:23
#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-and-moving-delta/TestsRotatingMovingDelta.gd:35
msgid "Did you use move_local_x() to make the sprite move locally?"
msgstr "스프라이트를 로컬로 이동시키기 위해 move_local_x()를 사용하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-10-the-game-loop/rotating-and-moving/TestsRotatingAndMoving.gd:26
#: course/lesson-10-the-game-loop/rotating-sprite/TestsRotating.gd:30
#: course/lesson-10-the-game-loop/rotating-sprite/TestsRotating.gd:33
msgid "The robot is turning in the wrong direction!"
msgstr "로봇이 잘못된 방향으로 회전하고 있어요!"

#: course/lesson-10-the-game-loop/rotating-and-moving/TestsRotatingAndMoving.gd:28
msgid "The character didn't move as expected."
msgstr "캐릭터가 예상대로 움직이지 않았습니다."

#: course/lesson-10-the-game-loop/rotating-sprite/TestsRotating.gd:10
msgid "Character Is Rotating Clockwise"
msgstr "캐릭터가 시계 방향으로 회전하고 있습니다."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-and-moving-delta/TestsRotatingMovingDelta.gd:20
msgid "Moving In A Circle"
msgstr "원으로 이동"

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-and-moving-delta/TestsRotatingMovingDelta.gd:21
msgid "Movement Is Time Dependent"
msgstr "움직임은 시간에 따라 달라집니다"

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-and-moving-delta/TestsRotatingMovingDelta.gd:22
msgid "Movement Speed Is Correct"
msgstr "이동 속도가 정확합니다"

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-and-moving-delta/TestsRotatingMovingDelta.gd:47
msgid ""
"You need to use delta in your code. Multiplying by delta makes the movement "
"time-dependent."
msgstr "코드에서 delta를 사용해야 합니다. delta를 곱하면 이동이 시간에 따라 달라집니다."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-and-moving-delta/TestsRotatingMovingDelta.gd:48
msgid ""
"Both rotate() and move_local_x() need to multiply their value by delta, like"
" this: rotate(2 * delta) and move_local_x(100 * delta)."
msgstr ""
"rotate()와 move_local_x() 모두 다음과 같이 값에 델타를 곱해야 합니다:rotate(2 * delta) 및 "
"move_local_x(100 * delta)."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-and-moving-delta/TestsRotatingMovingDelta.gd:55
#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-using-delta/TestsRotatingDelta.gd:45
msgid "The _process function is missing; did you remove it?"
msgstr "_process 함수가 누락되었습니다. 이 함수를 삭제했나요?"

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-and-moving-delta/TestsRotatingMovingDelta.gd:69
msgid ""
"It looks like you stored values in variables before passing them to the "
"functions."
msgstr "함수에 값을 전달하기 전에 변수에 값을 저장한 것 같습니다."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-and-moving-delta/TestsRotatingMovingDelta.gd:70
msgid ""
"That works in GDScript, but we cannot check the values automatically here."
msgstr "이는 GDScript에서 작동하지만 여기서는 값을 자동으로 확인할 수 없습니다."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-and-moving-delta/TestsRotatingMovingDelta.gd:71
msgid ""
"Please write the values directly inside the function calls, like this: "
"rotate(2 * delta) and move_local_x(100 * delta)."
msgstr ""
"다음과 같이 함수 호출 내부에 값을 직접 작성하십시오:rotate(2 * delta) 및 move_local_x(100 * delta)."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-using-delta/TestsRotatingDelta.gd:23
msgid "Rotating Character Is Time Dependent"
msgstr "캐릭터 회전은 시간에 따라 달라집니다."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-using-delta/TestsRotatingDelta.gd:24
msgid "Rotation Speed Is 2 Radians Per Second"
msgstr "회전 속도는 초당 2라디안입니다."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-using-delta/TestsRotatingDelta.gd:31
msgid ""
"You need to use delta in the rotate() call. Delta is what makes the rotation"
" time-dependent. Try rotate(2 * delta)."
msgstr ""
"rotate() 호출에서 Delta를 사용해야 합니다. Delta는 회전을 시간에 따라 다르게 만드는 것입니다. rotate(2 * "
"delta)을 시도해 보십시오."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-using-delta/TestsRotatingDelta.gd:38
msgid ""
"Delta needs to be inside the parentheses of rotate(), not outside. You need "
"to multiply the speed value by delta inside the call, like this: rotate(2 * "
"delta)."
msgstr ""
"Delta는 rotate()의 괄호 외부가 아닌 내부에 있어야 합니다. 다음과 같이 호출 내에서 속도 값에 델타를 곱해야 "
"합니다(rotate(2 * delta))."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-using-delta/TestsRotatingDelta.gd:53
msgid "It looks like you stored the value in a variable before using it."
msgstr "사용하기 전에 변수에 값을 저장한 것 같습니다."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-using-delta/TestsRotatingDelta.gd:54
msgid "That's valid, but we can't check the value automatically."
msgstr "유효하지만 값을 자동으로 확인할 수는 없습니다."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-using-delta/TestsRotatingDelta.gd:55
msgid "Please write it directly in the function call: rotate(2 * delta)."
msgstr "함수 호출에 직접 작성해 주세요(rotate(2 * delta))."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-using-delta/TestsRotatingDelta.gd:63
msgid "It looks like delta is not being multiplied."
msgstr "delta가 곱해지지 않는 것 같습니다."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-using-delta/TestsRotatingDelta.gd:64
msgid ""
"You need to use the * sign to multiply the speed by delta inside the "
"parentheses, like this: rotate(2 * delta)."
msgstr "rotate(2 * delta)처럼 괄호 안의 속도에 델타를 곱하려면 * 기호를 사용해야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-11-time-delta/rotating-using-delta/TestsRotatingDelta.gd:77
msgid ""
"The rotation speed is not right. The robot should rotate 2 radians per "
"second. Make sure the call looks like this: rotate(2 * delta)."
msgstr ""
"회전 속도가 올바르지 않습니다. 로봇은 초당 2라디안을 회전해야 합니다. 호출이 다음과 같은지 확인하세요: rotate(2 * "
"delta)."

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/clarify/TestClarifyCode.gd:17
msgid "Angular Speed Variable Is Script Wide"
msgstr "각속도 변수는 스크립트 범위입니다"

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/clarify/TestClarifyCode.gd:18
#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:18
msgid "Angular Speed Has Value Of 4"
msgstr "각속도의 값은 4입니다."

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/clarify/TestClarifyCode.gd:19
#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:19
msgid "Angular Speed Is Used In Process Function"
msgstr "각속도는 프로세스 함수에 사용됩니다."

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/clarify/TestClarifyCode.gd:24
msgid ""
"The angular_speed isn't script-wide. Did you define it outside of the "
"function?"
msgstr "angular_speed는 스크립트 전체가 아닙니다. 함수 외부에서 정의했나요?"

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/clarify/TestClarifyCode.gd:30
msgid ""
"The angular speed variable doesn't exist or isn't script-wide. Make it "
"script-wide first."
msgstr "각속도 변수가 존재하지 않거나 스크립트 전체에 적용되지 않습니다. 먼저 스크립트 전체로 만드십시오."

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/clarify/TestClarifyCode.gd:34
#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:36
msgid "Angular speed variable's value is %s; It should be 4."
msgstr "각속도 변수의 값은 %s입니다. 4가 되어야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/clarify/TestClarifyCode.gd:40
#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:42
#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:59
msgid "The '_process(delta)' function is missing; did you remove it?"
msgstr "'_process(delta)' 함수가 누락되었습니다. 이 함수를 삭제했나요?"

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/clarify/TestClarifyCode.gd:51
#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:51
msgid ""
"The rotate() call must multiply angular_speed by delta (e.g. "
"rotate(angular_speed * delta))."
msgstr ""
"rotate() 호출에서는 angular_speed에 delta를 곱해야 합니다(예: rotate(angular_speed * "
"delta))."

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:17
msgid "Has Angular Speed Variable"
msgstr "각속도 변수 있음"

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:20
msgid "Each Function Uses The Same Variable"
msgstr "각 함수는 동일한 변수를 사용합니다."

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:21
msgid "Angular Speed Is Used In Setter Function"
msgstr "각속도는 Setter 함수에 사용됩니다."

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:26
msgid ""
"The angular_speed variable doesn't exist. Did you define it with the var "
"keyword?"
msgstr "angular_speed 변수가 존재하지 않습니다. var 키워드로 정의하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:32
msgid ""
"The angular speed variable doesn't exist, can't test if it has a value of 4."
msgstr "각속도 변수가 존재하지 않으며 값이 4인지 테스트할 수 없습니다."

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:63
msgid ""
"It looks like you declared angular_speed more than once. It should only be "
"defined once."
msgstr "angular_speed를 두 번 이상 선언한 것 같습니다. 한 번만 정의해야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:70
msgid ""
"The 'set_angular_speed(new_angular_speed)' function is missing; did you "
"remove it?"
msgstr "'set_angular_speed(new_angular_speed)' 함수가 없습니다. 이 함수를 삭제했나요?"

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/fixing_error/TestFixingError.gd:78
msgid ""
"The set_angular_speed() function doesn't seem to use the angular_speed "
"variable."
msgstr "set_angular_speed() 함수가 angular_speed 변수를 사용하지 않는 것 같습니다."

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/limiting_health/TestLimitingHealth.gd:13
msgid "Health Does Not Go Above 80"
msgstr "체력이 80을 넘지 않음"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/limiting_health/TestLimitingHealth.gd:14
msgid "Health Limit Is Not Too Low"
msgstr "체력 한도가 너무 낮지 않음"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/limiting_health/TestLimitingHealth.gd:15
#: course/lesson-13-conditions/prevent_zero_health/TestPreventZeroHealth.gd:15
msgid "Health Takes Different Values"
msgstr "체력이 다양한 값을 가짐"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/limiting_health/TestLimitingHealth.gd:20
msgid ""
"The health goes above 80 when we heal the character a lot. Did you set the "
"health to 80 when that happens?"
msgstr "캐릭터를 많이 치료하면 체력이 80 이상으로 올라갑니다. 그럴때 체력을 80으로 설정하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/limiting_health/TestLimitingHealth.gd:26
msgid ""
"The health limit is too low when we heal the character. Did you set the "
"correct limit?"
msgstr "캐릭터를 치료할 때 체력 한계가 너무 낮습니다. 한도를 올바르게 설정하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/limiting_health/TestLimitingHealth.gd:35
msgid ""
"When healing the character twice by 40 points, the health should go up to 60, then 80. Instead, we got %s.\n"
"Are you using the amount parameter?"
msgstr ""
"캐릭터를 40포인트씩 두 번 치료하면 체력이 60, 그다음 80까지 올라가야 합니다. 현재 값은 %s입니다.\n"
"amount 매개변수를 사용했나요?"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/prevent_zero_health/TestPreventZeroHealth.gd:13
msgid "Health Reaches Zero"
msgstr "체력이 0에 도달함"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/prevent_zero_health/TestPreventZeroHealth.gd:14
msgid "Health Does Not Go Below Zero"
msgstr "체력이 0 아래로 내려가지 않음"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/prevent_zero_health/TestPreventZeroHealth.gd:20
msgid ""
"The health stays above 0 when we damage the character a lot. Did you set the"
" health to 0 when that happens?"
msgstr "캐릭터에게 큰 피해를 입힐 때 체력은 0 이상으로 유지됩니다. 그럴때 체력을 0으로 설정하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/prevent_zero_health/TestPreventZeroHealth.gd:26
msgid ""
"The health becomes negative if we deal 400 damage to the character. Did you "
"set it to 0?"
msgstr "캐릭터에게 400의 피해를 입히면 체력이 마이너스가 됩니다. 0으로 설정하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/prevent_zero_health/TestPreventZeroHealth.gd:32
msgid ""
"When damaging the character three times by 10 points, the health should go down to 10, then 0. Instead, we got %s.\n"
"Are you using the amount parameter?"
msgstr ""
"캐릭터에 10포인트씩 세 번 피해를 주면 체력이 10, 그다음 0까지 내려가야 합니다. 현재 값은 %s입니다.\n"
"amount 매개변수를 사용했나요?"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/using_conditions/TestUsingConditions.gd:5
msgid "Statement 1 Is True"
msgstr "진술 1은 사실입니다"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/using_conditions/TestUsingConditions.gd:6
msgid "Statement 2 Is True"
msgstr "진술 2는 사실입니다"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/using_conditions/TestUsingConditions.gd:7
msgid "Statement 3 Is True"
msgstr "진술 3은 사실입니다"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/using_conditions/TestUsingConditions.gd:8
msgid "Statement 4 Is True"
msgstr "진술 4는 사실입니다"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/using_conditions/TestUsingConditions.gd:23
msgid "The first comparison is not correct. Did you use the right comparison?"
msgstr "첫 번째 비교가 올바르지 않습니다. 올바른 비교를 사용하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/using_conditions/TestUsingConditions.gd:39
msgid ""
"The second comparison is not correct. Did you use the right comparison?"
msgstr "두 번째 비교가 올바르지 않습니다. 올바른 비교를 사용하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/using_conditions/TestUsingConditions.gd:55
msgid "The third comparison is not correct. Did you use the right comparison?"
msgstr "세 번째 비교는 올바르지 않습니다. 올바른 비교를 사용하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-13-conditions/using_conditions/TestUsingConditions.gd:71
msgid ""
"The fourth comparison is not correct. Did you use the right comparison?"
msgstr "네 번째 비교가 올바르지 않습니다. 올바른 비교를 사용하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/increase_max_health/TestHealthIncreased.gd:11
msgid "Addition Is Used To Increase Level"
msgstr "추가는 레벨을 높이는 데 사용됩니다."

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/increase_max_health/TestHealthIncreased.gd:12
msgid "Multiplication Is Used To Increase Max Health"
msgstr "곱셈은 최대 체력을 높이는 데 사용됩니다."

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/increase_max_health/TestHealthIncreased.gd:13
msgid "Level Is The Correct Value"
msgstr "레벨이 올바른 값입니다"

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/increase_max_health/TestHealthIncreased.gd:14
msgid "Max Health Is The Correct Value"
msgstr "최대 체력이 올바른 값입니다"

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/increase_max_health/TestHealthIncreased.gd:28
msgid "It looks like level isn't increasing every level. Did you add 1 to it?"
msgstr "레벨이 올라갈 때마다 레벨이 오르는 것은 아닌 것 같습니다. 1을 더한건가요?"

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/increase_max_health/TestHealthIncreased.gd:46
msgid ""
"It looks like max_health isn't increasing exponentially. Did you multiply it"
" by a value greater than 1?"
msgstr "max_health가 기하급수적으로 증가하지 않는 것 같습니다. 1보다 큰 값을 곱했나요?"

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/increase_max_health/TestHealthIncreased.gd:54
msgid "Level variable's value is %s; It should be 3 after levelling up twice."
msgstr "레벨 변수의 값은 %s입니다. 두 번 레벨업하면 3이 되어야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/increase_max_health/TestHealthIncreased.gd:61
msgid ""
"Max health variable's value is %s; It should be 121 after levelling up "
"twice."
msgstr "최대 체력 변수의 값은 %s입니다. 두 번 레벨업하면 121이어야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/reducing_damage/TestReducingDamage.gd:28
msgid "Multiplication Is Used To Reduce Damage Amount"
msgstr "피해량을 줄이기 위해 곱셈을 사용합니다."

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/reducing_damage/TestReducingDamage.gd:29
msgid "Damage Amount Is Correct Value"
msgstr "피해량은 올바른 값입니다."

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/reducing_damage/TestReducingDamage.gd:36
#: course/lesson-9-adding-and-subtracting/taking-damage/TestDamagingRobot.gd:29
msgid "It looks like the take_damage function is missing; did you remove it?"
msgstr "take_damage 함수가 누락된 것 같습니다. 이 함수를 삭제했나요?"

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/reducing_damage/TestReducingDamage.gd:70
msgid ""
"It looks like amount isn't reduced by a percentage. Did you multiply it by a"
" value less than 1?"
msgstr "amount가 백분율만큼 줄지 않은 것 같습니다. 1보다 작은 값을 곱했나요?"

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/reducing_damage/TestReducingDamage.gd:76
msgid ""
"The character did not take half damage despite being level 3. Did you "
"multiply the amount by 0.5 to reduce it?"
msgstr "캐릭터가 3레벨임에도 불구하고 절반의 데미지를 받지 않았습니다. 0.5를 곱해서 줄이셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/reducing_damage/TestReducingDamage.gd:80
msgid ""
"The character appears not to be taking full damage when their level is below"
" 3. Did you use a condition to limit damage reduction to when the level is "
"greater or equal to 3?"
msgstr ""
"캐릭터의 레벨이 3 미만일 때 피해를 완전히 받지 않는 것 같습니다. 레벨이 3 이상일 때만 피해 감소를 제한하는 조건을 사용하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-14-multiplying/reducing_damage/TestReducingDamage.gd:82
msgid ""
"The character appears to be taking 0 damage when its level is less than 3. "
"Did you subtract the amount to health when the level is less than 3?"
msgstr "캐릭터의 레벨이 3 미만일 때 데미지가 0이 되는 것 같습니다. 레벨이 3 미만일 때 체력을 빼셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-16-2d-vectors/increase_scale/TestScaleIncreased.gd:11
msgid "Use A Vector To Increase Scale"
msgstr "벡터를 사용하여 규모 확대"

#: course/lesson-16-2d-vectors/increase_scale/TestScaleIncreased.gd:12
msgid "Correct Scale After 2 Levels"
msgstr "2레벨 이후 올바른 스케일"

#: course/lesson-16-2d-vectors/increase_scale/TestScaleIncreased.gd:38
msgid ""
"It looks like the scale isn't increasing by some vector. Did you add a "
"vector to scale?"
msgstr "일부 벡터에 의해 규모가 증가하지 않는 것 같습니다. 크기를 조정할 벡터를 추가하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-16-2d-vectors/increase_scale/TestScaleIncreased.gd:48
msgid ""
"scale's value is %s; It should be (1.4, 1.4) after levelling up 2 times."
msgstr "스케일 값은 %s입니다. 2번 레벨업하면 (1.4, 1.4)가 되어야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-16-2d-vectors/resetting_robot/TestRobotReset.gd:11
msgid "Use Vector 2 To Reset Robot"
msgstr "벡터 2를 사용하여 로봇 재설정"

#: course/lesson-16-2d-vectors/resetting_robot/TestRobotReset.gd:12
msgid "Robot Scale Is Reset"
msgstr "로봇 스케일이 재설정되었습니다."

#: course/lesson-16-2d-vectors/resetting_robot/TestRobotReset.gd:13
msgid "Robot Position Is Reset"
msgstr "로봇 위치가 재설정되었습니다."

#: course/lesson-16-2d-vectors/resetting_robot/TestRobotReset.gd:72
msgid ""
"It looks like scale or position isn't reset using a Vector2 (directly or via"
" a Vector2 variable)."
msgstr "Vector2를 사용하여(직접 또는 Vector2 변수를 통해) 배율이나 위치가 재설정되지 않는 것 같습니다."

#: course/lesson-16-2d-vectors/resetting_robot/TestRobotReset.gd:79
msgid "scale's value is %s; It should be (1.0, 1.0) after resetting."
msgstr "스케일 값은 %s입니다. 재설정 후에는 (1.0, 1.0)이어야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-16-2d-vectors/resetting_robot/TestRobotReset.gd:86
msgid "position's value is %s; It should be (0.0, 0.0) after resetting."
msgstr "위치 값은 %s입니다. 재설정 후에는 (0.0, 0.0)이어야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-17-while-loops/while_move/TestPracticeBoardWhile.gd:11
#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_move/TestPracticeBoardFor.gd:11
msgid "Robot Gets To Bottom Of Board"
msgstr "로봇이 보드 바닥에 도달함"

#: course/lesson-17-while-loops/while_move/TestPracticeBoardWhile.gd:12
msgid "Use While Loop"
msgstr "While 루프 사용"

#: course/lesson-17-while-loops/while_move/TestPracticeBoardWhile.gd:17
#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_move/TestPracticeBoardFor.gd:17
msgid ""
"The robot isn't at the bottom of the game board. Did you increase its cell.y"
" coordinate?"
msgstr "로봇은 게임판 맨 아래에 있지 않습니다. cell.y 좌표를 늘렸나요?"

#: course/lesson-17-while-loops/while_move/TestPracticeBoardWhile.gd:23
msgid ""
"Your code has no while loop. You need to use a while loop to complete this "
"practice, even if there are other solutions!"
msgstr ""
"귀하의 코드에는 while 루프가 없습니다. 다른 해결 방법이 있더라도 이 연습을 완료하려면 while 루프를 사용해야 합니다!"

#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_move/TestPracticeBoardFor.gd:12
#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_rectangles/ForTestsDrawingRectangles.gd:36
#: course/lesson-21-strings/string_array/TestsStringArray.gd:12
msgid "Use For Loop"
msgstr "For 루프 사용"

#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_move/TestPracticeBoardFor.gd:23
#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_rectangles/ForTestsDrawingRectangles.gd:44
#: course/lesson-21-strings/string_array/TestsStringArray.gd:23
#: course/lesson-26-looping-over-dictionaries/display-inventory/TestDisplayInventory.gd:40
#: course/lesson-26-looping-over-dictionaries/place-units/TestPlaceUnits.gd:39
msgid ""
"Your code has no for loop. You need to use a for loop to complete this "
"practice, even if there are other solutions!"
msgstr "코드에 for 루프가 없습니다. 다른 해결 방법이 있더라도 이 연습을 완료하려면 for 루프를 사용해야 합니다!"

#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_rectangles/ForTestsDrawingRectangles.gd:37
#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangles_at_positions/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:36
msgid "Draw Three Squares"
msgstr "세 개의 정사각형 그리기"

#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_rectangles/ForTestsDrawingRectangles.gd:38
#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangles_at_positions/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:37
msgid "Squares Are All 100 By 100"
msgstr "정사각형은 모두 100x100입니다."

#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_rectangles/ForTestsDrawingRectangles.gd:39
#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangles_at_positions/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:39
msgid "Shapes Are 100 Pixels Apart"
msgstr "도형은 100픽셀 떨어져 있습니다."

#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_rectangles/ForTestsDrawingRectangles.gd:51
#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangles_at_positions/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:45
msgid "You drew %s squares but you need to draw 3."
msgstr "%s 정사각형을 그렸지만 3개를 그려야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_rectangles/ForTestsDrawingRectangles.gd:67
#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangles_at_positions/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:53
msgid "Shape3D number %s is not a square of size 100 by 100."
msgstr "Shape3D 숫자 %s는 100 x 100 크기의 정사각형이 아닙니다."

#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_rectangles/ForTestsDrawingRectangles.gd:74
#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangles_at_positions/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:71
msgid ""
"There are fewer than 3 shapes, we can't test if shapes are 100 pixels apart."
msgstr "모양이 3개 미만이므로 모양이 100픽셀 떨어져 있는지 테스트할 수 없습니다."

#: course/lesson-18-for-loops/for_rectangles/ForTestsDrawingRectangles.gd:81
#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangles_at_positions/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:78
msgid "Shapes are not separated by 100 pixels on the X axis."
msgstr "모양은 X축에서 100픽셀로 구분되지 않습니다."

#: course/lesson-19-creating-arrays/moving-turtle/TestMovingTurtle.gd:15
msgid "Path Is Contiguous"
msgstr "경로가 연속적임"

#: course/lesson-19-creating-arrays/moving-turtle/TestMovingTurtle.gd:16
msgid "Turtle Reaches The Robot"
msgstr "거북이가 로봇에 닿다"

#: course/lesson-19-creating-arrays/moving-turtle/TestMovingTurtle.gd:17
msgid "Path Does Not Hit Obstacles"
msgstr "경로가 장애물에 부딪치지 않음"

#: course/lesson-19-creating-arrays/moving-turtle/TestMovingTurtle.gd:22
msgid ""
"No points found in variable turtle_path. Did you write Vector2 coordinates "
"in the variable's array?"
msgstr "변수 turtle_path에서 포인트를 찾을 수 없습니다. 변수 배열에 Vector2 좌표를 썼나요?"

#: course/lesson-19-creating-arrays/moving-turtle/TestMovingTurtle.gd:27
msgid ""
"We found at least two points that are not next to one another. Did you "
"forget some coordinates, or did you try to move the turtle diagonally?"
msgstr "서로 인접하지 않은 점을 두 개 이상 발견했습니다. 좌표를 잊어버렸나요, 아니면 거북이를 대각선으로 움직이려고 했나요?"

#: course/lesson-19-creating-arrays/moving-turtle/TestMovingTurtle.gd:36
msgid ""
"The last point should be at the robot's coordinates, %s, but it is %s "
"instead."
msgstr "마지막 점은 로봇의 좌표인 %s에 있어야 하지만 대신 %s입니다."

#: course/lesson-19-creating-arrays/moving-turtle/TestMovingTurtle.gd:45
msgid "The turtle hit a rock at coordinates %s. You need to change its path."
msgstr "거북이는 %s 좌표에서 바위에 부딪혔습니다. 경로를 변경해야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-19-creating-arrays/selecting-units/TestSelectingUnits.gd:13
msgid "All Units Are Selected"
msgstr "모든 단위가 선택되었습니다."

#: course/lesson-19-creating-arrays/selecting-units/TestSelectingUnits.gd:14
msgid "Only Units Are Selected"
msgstr "단위만 선택됩니다"

#: course/lesson-19-creating-arrays/selecting-units/TestSelectingUnits.gd:20
msgid "Unit in cell %s not selected."
msgstr "%s 셀의 단위가 선택되지 않았습니다."

#: course/lesson-19-creating-arrays/selecting-units/TestSelectingUnits.gd:27
msgid "Trying to select a cell that doesn't contain a unit: %s."
msgstr "단위가 포함되지 않은 셀을 선택하려고 합니다: %s."

#: course/lesson-2-your-first-error/first-error/TestsFixError.gd:4
msgid "Remove Errors"
msgstr "오류 제거"

#: course/lesson-2-your-first-error/first-error/TestsFixError.gd:10
msgid ""
"There's still a comment in your code. You need to remove the comment sign "
"(#)."
msgstr "코드에 아직 주석이 있습니다. 주석 기호(#)를 제거해야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/drawing-in-loops/TestsDrawingInLoops.gd:37
msgid "Rectangles Have The Correct Size"
msgstr "직사각형의 크기가 정확함"

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/drawing-in-loops/TestsDrawingInLoops.gd:38
msgid "Rectangles Do Not Overlap"
msgstr "직사각형이 겹치지 않음"

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/drawing-in-loops/TestsDrawingInLoops.gd:43
msgid "We expected 4 polygons, but you drew %s instead."
msgstr "4개의 다각형을 예상했지만 대신 %s를 그렸습니다."

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/drawing-in-loops/TestsDrawingInLoops.gd:47
msgid "At least one of the rectangles does not have the expected size."
msgstr "직사각형 중 하나 이상이 예상 크기를 가지고 있지 않습니다."

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/drawing-in-loops/TestsDrawingInLoops.gd:58
msgid ""
"At least two drawn shape intersect. Did you pass arguments big enough to the"
" jump() function?"
msgstr "그려진 모양이 두 개 이상 교차합니다. jump() 함수에 충분히 큰 인수를 전달했습니까?"

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/robot-path/TestRobotPath.gd:17
msgid "Robot Moves Along Blue Path"
msgstr "로봇은 파란색 경로를 따라 이동"

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/robot-path/TestRobotPath.gd:18
msgid "Code Uses Move To"
msgstr "코드는 다음으로 이동을 사용합니다."

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/robot-path/TestRobotPath.gd:23
msgid "The robot's path changed. Did you change the robot_path array?"
msgstr "로봇의 경로가 변경되었습니다. robot_path 배열을 변경하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/robot-path/TestRobotPath.gd:26
msgid "The robot didn't move at all. Did you call robot.move_to()?"
msgstr "로봇이 전혀 움직이지 않았습니다. robot.move_to()를 호출했나요?"

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/robot-path/TestRobotPath.gd:31
msgid ""
"The robot moved fewer times than it should have. Did you use a loop and move"
" once for each point in the robot_path array?"
msgstr "로봇은 예상보다 적은 횟수로 움직였습니다. 루프를 사용하고 robot_path 배열의 각 지점에 대해 한 번씩 이동했습니까?"

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/robot-path/TestRobotPath.gd:38
msgid ""
"The robot's movement path doesn't match the robot_path array. They should be"
" the same."
msgstr "로봇의 이동 경로가 robot_path 배열과 일치하지 않습니다. 그것들은 동일해야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-20-looping-over-arrays/robot-path/TestRobotPath.gd:44
msgid ""
"We found no call to the robot's move_to() function. Did you forget to call "
"it?"
msgstr "로봇의 move_to() 함수에 대한 호출을 찾지 못했습니다. 전화하는 걸 잊었나요?"

#: course/lesson-21-strings/string_array/TestsStringArray.gd:13
msgid "Robot Combo Is Correct"
msgstr "로봇 콤보가 맞습니다"

#: course/lesson-21-strings/string_array/TestsStringArray.gd:20
msgid "The run function is missing; did you remove it?"
msgstr "run 함수가 없습니다. 이 함수를 삭제했나요?"

#: course/lesson-21-strings/string_array/TestsStringArray.gd:34
msgid ""
"Your code does not play any animations. Did you remember to call "
"play_animation() in your for loop?"
msgstr "귀하의 코드는 애니메이션을 재생하지 않습니다. for 루프에서 play_animation()을 호출하는 것을 기억하시나요?"

#: course/lesson-21-strings/string_array/TestsStringArray.gd:48
msgid ""
"It seems you're passing the entire array of combos instead of a single "
"animation name at a time."
msgstr "한 번에 하나의 애니메이션 이름 대신 전체 콤보 배열을 전달하는 것 같습니다."

#: course/lesson-21-strings/string_array/TestsStringArray.gd:63
msgid ""
"Your code does not use the iterator. Did you remember to call "
"play_animation(%s) in your for loop?"
msgstr "귀하의 코드는 반복자를 사용하지 않습니다. for 루프에서 play_animation(%s)을 호출하는 것을 기억했나요?"

#: course/lesson-21-strings/string_array/TestsStringArray.gd:85
msgid ""
"The combo isn't correct. Did you use the right actions in the right order?"
msgstr "콤보가 올바르지 않습니다. 올바른 작업을 올바른 순서로 사용했습니까?"

#: course/lesson-21-strings/string_error/TestsStringError.gd:17
