#: course/lesson-5-your-first-function/TestsDrawingThreeSquares.gd:20
msgid "Nothing drawn. Did you not call draw_square()?"
msgstr "아무것도 그려지지 않았습니다. draw_square()를 호출하지 않았나요?"

#: course/lesson-5-your-first-function/TestsDrawingThreeSquares.gd:24
msgid "You only drew one square. You need to draw three."
msgstr "정사각형 하나만 그렸습니다. 3개를 그려야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-5-your-first-function/TestsDrawingThreeSquares.gd:26
msgid "You need to draw three squares."
msgstr "세 개의 정사각형을 그려야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-5-your-first-function/TestsDrawingThreeSquares.gd:29
#: course/lesson-5-your-first-function/TestsDrawingThreeSquares.gd:31
msgid "You drew more than three squares. You need to draw only three!"
msgstr "정사각형을 3개 이상 그렸습니다. 3개만 그려주시면 됩니다!"

#: course/lesson-5-your-first-function/TestsDrawingThreeSquares.gd:39
msgid ""
"Shape3D number %s has too few corners! Did you change the draw_square() "
"function?"
msgstr "Shape3D 번호 %s에 모서리가 너무 적습니다! draw_square() 함수를 변경하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-5-your-first-function/TestsDrawingThreeSquares.gd:44
msgid ""
"Shape3D number %s has too many corners! Did you change the draw_square() "
"function?"
msgstr "Shape3D 번호 %s에 모서리가 너무 많습니다! draw_square() 함수를 변경하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-5-your-first-function/TestsDrawingThreeSquares.gd:55
msgid ""
"Shape3D number %s is not a square of length 200 pixels. Did you change the "
"draw_square() function?"
msgstr "Shape3D 숫자 %s는 길이 200픽셀의 정사각형이 아닙니다. draw_square() 함수를 변경하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-5-your-first-function/TestsDrawingThreeSquares.gd:67
msgid ""
"The squares should not overlap. Did you move the turtle between drawing each"
" square?"
msgstr "사각형은 겹쳐서는 안됩니다. 각 사각형을 그리는 사이에 거북이를 움직였나요?"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_corners/TestsDrawingCorners.gd:16
msgid "Draw Corners Of Varying Lengths"
msgstr "다양한 길이의 모서리 그리기"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_corners/TestsDrawingCorners.gd:23
#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_corners_advanced/TestsDrawingCornersAdvanced.gd:22
#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_squares/TestsDrawingSquares.gd:28
#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_squares/TestsDrawingSquares.gd:43
#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_squares/TestsDrawingSquares.gd:54
msgid ""
"The turtle did not draw anything. Make sure your function calls "
"move_forward(length) to move the turtle."
msgstr ""
"거북이는 아무것도 그리지 않았습니다. 거북이를 이동하려면 함수가 move_forward(length)를 호출하는지 확인하세요."

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_corners/TestsDrawingCorners.gd:30
#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_corners_advanced/TestsDrawingCornersAdvanced.gd:29
msgid ""
"The drawn shape has too many points. Did you call move_forward() more than 2"
" times?"
msgstr "그려진 모양에 점이 너무 많습니다. move_forward()를 2번 이상 호출하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_corners/TestsDrawingCorners.gd:32
#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_corners_advanced/TestsDrawingCornersAdvanced.gd:31
msgid ""
"The drawn shape has too few points. Did you call move_forward() less than 2 "
"times?"
msgstr "그려진 모양에 점이 너무 적습니다. move_forward()를 2회 미만 호출했습니까?"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_corners/TestsDrawingCorners.gd:34
msgid ""
"The drawn shape doesn't have the expected size. Did you use the length "
"parameter?"
msgstr "그려진 모양의 크기가 예상한 크기가 아닙니다. 길이 매개변수를 사용하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_corners_advanced/TestsDrawingCornersAdvanced.gd:15
msgid "Draw Corners Of Varying Sizes And Angles"
msgstr "다양한 크기와 각도의 모서리 그리기"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_corners_advanced/TestsDrawingCornersAdvanced.gd:34
msgid ""
"The drawn corner doesn't match the expected corner. Are you not using the "
"angle parameter in your code?"
msgstr "그려진 모서리가 예상 모서리와 일치하지 않습니다. 코드에서 angle 매개변수를 사용하고 있지 않습니까?"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_rectangles/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:22
msgid "Draw Rectangles Of Varying Sizes"
msgstr "다양한 크기의 직사각형 그리기"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_rectangles/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:29
msgid ""
"The turtle did not draw anything. Make sure your function calls "
"move_forward() with the length and height parameters."
msgstr ""
"거북이는 아무것도 그리지 않았습니다. 함수가 길이 및 높이 매개변수를 사용하여 move_forward()를 호출하는지 확인하세요."

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_rectangles/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:40
#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_squares/TestsDrawingSquares.gd:61
msgid ""
"The drawn shape has too many points. Did you call move_forward() more than 4"
" times?"
msgstr "그려진 모양에 점이 너무 많습니다. move_forward()를 4번 이상 호출하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_rectangles/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:42
#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_squares/TestsDrawingSquares.gd:65
msgid ""
"The drawn shape has too few points. Did you call move_forward() less than 4 "
"times?"
msgstr "그려진 모양에 점이 너무 적습니다. move_forward()를 4회 미만 호출했습니까?"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_rectangles/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:45
msgid ""
"The length and height are inverted. Did you swap the length and height "
"function arguments?"
msgstr "길이와 높이가 반전됩니다. 길이와 높이 함수 인수를 바꿨나요?"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_rectangles/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:47
#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangle_at_position/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:34
msgid ""
"The drawn shapes don't have the expected length and height. Did you forget "
"to use the length and height parameter?"
msgstr "그려진 모양에 예상 길이와 높이가 없습니다. 길이와 높이 매개변수를 사용하는 것을 잊으셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_squares/TestsDrawingSquares.gd:21
msgid "Turtle Ends Facing Towards The Right"
msgstr "거북이 끝이 오른쪽을 향하고 있음"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_squares/TestsDrawingSquares.gd:22
msgid "Turtle Starts Each Square Facing Towards The Right"
msgstr "거북이는 오른쪽을 향해 각 사각형을 시작합니다"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_squares/TestsDrawingSquares.gd:23
msgid "Draw Squares Of Varying Sizes"
msgstr "다양한 크기의 사각형 그리기"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_squares/TestsDrawingSquares.gd:37
msgid ""
"The turtle should turn four times to draw a square so that it always starts "
"drawing the squares in the same direction. Did you call turn_right() four "
"times?"
msgstr ""
"거북이가 사각형을 그리려면 네 번 회전해야 사각형이 항상 같은 방향으로 그려지기 시작합니다. turn_right()를 네 번 "
"호출하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_squares/TestsDrawingSquares.gd:45
msgid ""
"The turtle should be facing towards the right to draw squares in the same "
"direction every time. Did you call turn_right(90) four times in your "
"function?"
msgstr ""
"매번 같은 방향으로 사각형을 그리려면 거북이가 오른쪽을 향하고 있어야 합니다. 함수에서 turn_right(90)를 네 번 호출했습니까?"

#: course/lesson-6-multiple-function-parameters/drawing_squares/TestsDrawingSquares.gd:69
msgid ""
"The shape is not a square or not turned in the expected direction. Did you "
"use 90 degree angles when calling turn_right()?"
msgstr ""
"모양이 정사각형이 아니거나 예상한 방향으로 회전하지 않습니다. turn_right()를 호출할 때 90도 각도를 사용했습니까?"

#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangle_at_position/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:12
msgid "Rectangle Starts At 120 By 100"
msgstr "직사각형은 120 x 100에서 시작합니다."

#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangle_at_position/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:13
msgid "Rectangle Size Is 200 By 120"
msgstr "직사각형 크기는 200 x 120입니다."

#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangle_at_position/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:20
#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangle_at_position/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:30
msgid ""
"We didn't find any drawn rectangles. Did you forget to call "
"draw_rectangle()?"
msgstr "그려진 직사각형을 찾지 못했습니다. draw_rectangle()을 호출하는 것을 잊으셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangle_at_position/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:23
msgid ""
"The rectangle doesn't start at position (120, 100). Did you not set the "
"position right?"
msgstr "직사각형은 위치 (120, 100)에서 시작하지 않습니다. 위치를 제대로 설정하지 않았나요?"

#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangles_at_positions/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:38
msgid "First Shape Is At 100 By 100"
msgstr "첫 번째 모양은 100 x 100입니다."

#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangles_at_positions/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:61
msgid "No shape drawn. Did you forget to call draw_rectangle()?"
msgstr "도형이 그려지지 않았습니다. draw_rectangle()을 호출하는 것을 잊으셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-7-member-variables/draw_rectangles_at_positions/TestsDrawingRectangles.gd:64
msgid ""
"The first square should be drawn at (100, 100). Instead, you drew it at %s."
msgstr "첫 번째 정사각형은 (100, 100)에 그려져야 합니다. 대신 %s에 그렸습니다."

#: course/lesson-8-defining-variables/define-health-variable/TestHasHealthVar.gd:15
msgid "Has Health Variable"
msgstr "체력 변수가 있음"

#: course/lesson-8-defining-variables/define-health-variable/TestHasHealthVar.gd:16
msgid "Health Has Value Of 100"
msgstr "체력 값이 100임"

#: course/lesson-8-defining-variables/define-health-variable/TestHasHealthVar.gd:21
msgid ""
"The health variable doesn't exist. Did you define it with the var keyword?"
msgstr "체력 변수가 존재하지 않습니다. var 키워드로 정의하셨나요?"

#: course/lesson-8-defining-variables/define-health-variable/TestHasHealthVar.gd:27
msgid "Health variable doesn't exist, can't test if it has a value of 100."
msgstr "체력 변수가 존재하지 않아 값이 100인지 테스트할 수 없습니다."

#: course/lesson-8-defining-variables/define-health-variable/TestHasHealthVar.gd:31
msgid ""
"Health's value is a text string. It should be a number. You need to remove "
"quotes around the value."
msgstr "Health 값은 텍스트 문자열입니다. 숫자여야 합니다. 값 주위의 따옴표를 제거해야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-8-defining-variables/define-health-variable/TestHasHealthVar.gd:33
msgid "Health's value should be a whole number. Instead it's a %s."
msgstr "체력 값은 정수여야 합니다. 현재 값은 %s입니다."

#: course/lesson-8-defining-variables/define-health-variable/TestHasHealthVar.gd:36
msgid "Health variable's value is %s; It should be 100."
msgstr "체력 변수의 값은 %s입니다. 100이어야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-9-adding-and-subtracting/healing/TestHealingRobot.gd:11
msgid "Robot Heals The Right Amount"
msgstr "로봇이 적절한 양을 치료합니다."

#: course/lesson-9-adding-and-subtracting/healing/TestHealingRobot.gd:12
msgid "Heal Function Uses Addition"
msgstr "치유 함수은 추가를 사용합니다"

#: course/lesson-9-adding-and-subtracting/healing/TestHealingRobot.gd:17
msgid ""
"The robot's health decreased instead of increasing. Did you add the amount "
"to health?"
msgstr "로봇의 체력이 증가하지 않고 감소했습니다. health에 amount를 더했나요?"

#: course/lesson-9-adding-and-subtracting/healing/TestHealingRobot.gd:20
msgid ""
"The robot didn't heal as expected. It has %s, but it should have 100 health."
msgstr "로봇은 예상대로 치료되지 않았습니다. %s가 있지만 체력은 100이어야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-9-adding-and-subtracting/healing/TestHealingRobot.gd:29
msgid "It doesn't look like you're adding anything to health."
msgstr "체력에 아무것도 추가하지 않는 것 같습니다."

#: course/lesson-9-adding-and-subtracting/taking-damage/TestDamagingRobot.gd:13
msgid "Robot Takes The Right Amount Of Damage"
msgstr "로봇은 적절한 양의 피해를 입습니다."

#: course/lesson-9-adding-and-subtracting/taking-damage/TestDamagingRobot.gd:14
msgid "Subtract Amount From Health"
msgstr "amount를 health에서 빼기"

#: course/lesson-9-adding-and-subtracting/taking-damage/TestDamagingRobot.gd:19
msgid ""
"The health goes above 100 when we damage the robot. Did you subract amount "
"from health?"
msgstr "로봇에게 피해를 주면 체력이 100을 넘습니다. health에서 amount를 뺐나요?"

#: course/lesson-9-adding-and-subtracting/taking-damage/TestDamagingRobot.gd:22
msgid ""
"The robot didn't take as much damage as expected. It has %s health, but it "
"should have 50 health after taking damage."
msgstr "로봇은 예상만큼 큰 피해를 입지 않았습니다. %s 체력을 가지고 있지만 피해를 입은 후에는 체력이 50이 되어야 합니다."

#: course/lesson-9-adding-and-subtracting/taking-damage/TestDamagingRobot.gd:51
msgid "It doesn't look like you're subtracting amount from health."
msgstr "amount를 health에서 빼지 않은 것 같습니다."

